# ============================================================================
# 15 September 2026, written again 18 September after the container took it.
#
# This repository had no .gitignore, so an `npm install` run inside it once put
# 4,886 node_modules files under version control - about 505,000 lines of
# vendored dependencies alongside 119 real ones. None of it ever reached
# GitHub, because every release ships one file at a time through the web upload
# UI; the remote has always held a clean 86 files. This file is what makes a
# future `git push` safe rather than a half-million-line accident.
#
# The test rig lives OUTSIDE this repo (in the session's own working dir) and
# must stay outside it: its suites quote the live book - client names and
# balances - and this repository is public.
# ============================================================================
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# scratch left by the test rig
lifted.js
_extract*.js
